COPY public.about_qualitycontent (id, title, description, image, quality_id) FROM stdin;
1	Laboratory Testing	Our laboratory services specialize in precision testing solutions tailored for automotive oils. Utilizing state-of-the-art equipment and expert analysis, we meticulously evaluate the quality and performance of each oil sample. From viscosity measurements to chemical composition analysis, our comprehensive testing ensures that our products meet the strictest standards of excellence, enhancing the performance and longevity of your engines.	quality/4b86f7401f4d003f3742b1873ccac39732a67e74.png	1
2	Reliable and Precise	We adhere to ISO standards in our laboratory practices, ensuring the highest levels of quality and reliability. Our commitment to compliance guarantees consistent and accurate analysis results, meeting industry benchmarks for excellence. With state-of-the-art equipment and advanced testing methodologies, we ensure accurate and reliable analysis results. Our cutting-edge technology allows us to deliver precise measurements and valuable insights into oil properties.	quality/19919f5d4e7fbb02d9d379039cbde3d0f1c5344e.png	1
\.
COPY public.about_sustainability (id, main_description) FROM stdin;
1	As a leading manufacturer of high-quality lubricants, we are committed to delivering solutions that align with global environmental standards and customer needs. This commitment drives our collaborations and investments in eco-friendly technologies and practices.
\.
COPY public.about_sustainabilitycontent (id, title, description, image, sustainability_id) FROM stdin;
1	Advanced Additive Solutions	Aminol partners with global leaders in additive technology, such as Lubrizol, Chevron, Infenium, and Afton to integrate advanced low-SAPS (Sulphated Ash, Phosphorus, and Sulfur) additive packages into our formulations. These solutions are designed to reduce emissions, enhance fuel efficiency, and protect modern engines, meeting the demands of increasingly stringent environmental regulations.	sustainability/474e6e2a93d8f34ef720e16266d7712fa7bce717.jpg	1
2	Research and Development	Beyond working with industry-leading additive suppliers, Aminol invests heavily in its research and development (R&D) programs to pioneer eco-friendly innovations. Our R&D initiatives focus on:\r\nCreating formulations tailored for hybrid and electric vehicles, as well as high-performance engines.\r\nDeveloping longer-lasting lubricants to reduce waste and minimize environmental impact. Exploring renewable and biodegradable components to advance sustainability in every stage of production.	sustainability/c04f0ad4885393d00162fb10b3e371b4b55f161a.png	1
3	Commitment to Excellence	Aminol’s close partnerships with the main global additive manufacturers allow us to stay ahead of the curve, incorporating the latest advancements in additive technology. By leveraging these innovations, we provide high-performance solutions that meet both the environmental and operational needs of our customers.	sustainability/79d89e3e6fe1b3a6b7964b172f8654ffc8fd4a7d.png	1
4	Our Vision for the Future	Sustainability is embedded in Aminol’s DNA. Through collaborative efforts, advanced R&D, and a commitment to innovation, we aim to lead the lubricant industry into a cleaner, greener future. Every product we deliver reflects our dedication to minimizing environmental impact while maximizing performance and reliability.	sustainability/19919f5d4e7fbb02d9d379039cbde3d0f1c5344e.png	1
\.
