COPY public.markets_markets_automotive (id, title, image, description) FROM stdin;
1	Knowledge and support	markets_automotive/c36bccd066165a4f964ce35f714a1c7ac4f5ee88.jpg	Our experienced team is ready to assist you with advice, technical and commercial support, and the latest industry developments. Discover our wide range of services and workshop materials on our service page.
\.
COPY public.markets_markets_automotive_content (id, title, description, image, markets_automotive_id) FROM stdin;
1	Innovating Lubrication for Modern Engines	Aminol™ is committed to delivering top-tier lubricants tailored to the needs of modern passenger vehicles. Whether you're driving a hybrid, gasoline, or diesel car, Aminol™ provides a complete range of high-performance lubricants that meet the most rigorous industry standards. Our advanced formulations ensure fuel efficiency, engine protection, and long-term sustainability, giving drivers confidence on the road.	markets_automotive_content/73a70e684d27f954330e7292c074c4bc5b261615.jpg	1
2	Proven to Provide Fuel Saving	In independent tests, Aminol™ Special Generation and Ultra Power have shown to provide fuel savings of up to 1.4%, translating to significant cost reductions for both individual drivers and fleet operators.\r\nAminol™ lubricants are engineered to improve fuel economy while providing exceptional engine protection	markets_automotive_content/1ae3d630491d728353a67b96237f182adeeec4ef.jpg	1
3	Engineered for Performance Under Extreme Conditions	Aminol™ understands the rigorous demands of heavy-duty engines operating in commercial fleets, off-highway vehicles, and heavy machinery. Our high-performance lubricants are specifically designed to meet the challenges of extreme temperatures, heavy loads, and extended oil drain intervals.\r\nAminol™ heavy-duty oils provide superior engine protection, extended service life, and improved fuel efficiency, making them the ideal choice for fleets operating under demanding conditions.	markets_automotive_content/6e5db3cd0be9fb12e70b52bcefaa9f6591fd4790.jpg	1
4	Proven Fuel Savings for Heavy-Duty Fleets	Aminol™ heavy-duty lubricants are engineered to improve fuel economy and reduce operating costs.\r\nIndependent testing shows that Aminol™ SLD and Premium PMD oils can provide fuel savings of up to 1.2%, which can significantly reduce the overall cost of fleet operations.	markets_automotive_content/3254f2f27d97470c739f295d4624fec3c0c6cda4.png	1
5	Expertise from the producer	From engine oils, transmission oils to coolants, sprays, and greases; we produce all products 'in house'. Thanks to our high-quality production facility, we can produce and switch quickly while ensuring top-notch quality. With our many years of experience as a manufacturer, we have broad application knowledge and provide you with expert advice for various lubrication-related issues.	markets_automotive_content/da7efcbc260a47884b21ec3e1581240807272fb8.jpg	1
\.
COPY public.markets_markets_industrial (id, title, image, description, industries_title, industries_description) FROM stdin;
1	OEM ENDORSEMENTS	markets_industrial/a1a669a2d42bddb1fb637b3f72351d0a48197649.jpg	Our OEM endorsements confirm that AMINOL lubricants undergo rigorous testing, ensuring compatibility and superior performance.Our logistics division ensures efficiency, door-to-door delivery through partnerships with major shipping lines, providing seamless access to key markets and minimizing downtime. \r\nWhen you choose AMINOL, you’re opting for lubricants that meet the industry's highest standards, enabling your machinery to handle even the toughest conditions with ease.	Comprehensive Solutions Across a Range of Industries and Beyond:	Our industrial solutions aren’t just limited to one or two sectors. We’ve made it our mission to keep the world running smoothly, no matter the industry. From the rough and tumble of mining to the delicate touch needed for food production, Aminol’s lubricants are here to keep everything moving like a well-oiled machine.
\.
COPY public.markets_markets_industrial_content (id, title, description, image, markets_industrial_id) FROM stdin;
1	Precision Lubrication for Every Season’s Demands.	Aminol industrial lubricants are engineered to meet the demanding requirements of modern machinery, reducing friction, wear, and downtime while promoting energy efficiency.Whether in manufacturing, transportation, or heavy industry, our products ensure smooth operation and extend the lifespan of your equipment.	markets_industrial_content/1ae3d630491d728353a67b96237f182adeeec4ef.jpg	1
2	Optimal lubrication and performance	At Aminol, we produce an extensive range of lubricants and technical fluids, specially formulated for the unique challenges of the industrial sector. From transmission to compressor oil, metalworking oils, gear greases, pneumatic fluids, and lubricating pastes - we have everything you need for optimal lubrication and protection	markets_industrial_content/6e5db3cd0be9fb12e70b52bcefaa9f6591fd4790.jpg	1
\.
