COPY public.services_aminol_labaratory (id, title, description, image) FROM stdin;
1	Reliable and precise	We are capable of carrying out reliable tests – to the accuracy of a millionth of a particle.\r\nWe have installed the necessary equipment to allow us to test lubricants for literally any parameter required.\r\nWe take every opportunity we have to randomly test our products against ATIEL, ISO, API and OEM standards.\r\nOur laboratory is independent of the management structure and delivers impartial results.	aminol_labaratory/695a0dac3e862bfdd0688c882696a4698bb1fc16.jpg
2	Research and development	Our personnel is encouraged to carry out tests that show where our products lack.\r\nWe use these tests to improve the tribological characteristics of our products while optimizing our formulas.\r\nWe also use analyses and tests to develop new products which have never been carried out in Azerbaijan and sometimes in the CIS region as a whole.	aminol_labaratory/bce2123486f725927f2e3c5dd4605b199a75fb3e.jpg
3	Autonomous High-Precision Testing Lab	- Accurate measurements down to a millionth of a  \r\n   particle.\r\n- Completely autonomous structure within the\r\n   company. - Tests performed based on international standards. - Reliable results.\r\n- Research and development capabilities.\r\n- The ability to perform tests associated with all \r\n   parameters of petro-chemicals, particularly lubricants.\r\n- Total investment: 6 million USD	aminol_labaratory/ede29faaf4b1c33f1cf0ff4f5802c8953afbfb03.jpg
\.
COPY public.services_aminol_logistics (id, title, description, image) FROM stdin;
1	Optimizing Operations for Seamless Global Delivery	AMINOL maintains its own distribution network in 37 countries solely for finished lubricants, showcasing an impressive annual production capacity of 60 million liters and a diverse product range exceeding 1000 items. Such capabilities firmly position AMINOL as a dominant force in both regional and global markets.	aminol_logistics/00f1c9d6f598e22792b5943b8e8fe462ac199691.jpg
2	Global delivery	Our logistics services are dedicated to optimizing supply chain operations for seamless global delivery. From order processing and inventory management to transportation logistics and distribution, we meticulously oversee every aspect of the supply chain process. By leveraging advanced technologies and strategic partnerships, we ensure efficient and timely delivery of our products to customers worldwide, meeting their demands with precision and reliability.	aminol_logistics/ca73837909bf4494cd1aff7f37103eb89bbdfaf8.jpg
\.
COPY public.services_aminol_official_dealer (id, title, title_description, image, description) FROM stdin;
1	What we offer for marketing:	We understand that strong marketing is key to driving sales and building trust in your market. That’s why we provide our distributors with full marketing support tailored to their region and audience.\r\n\r\nReady-to-use marketing materials Product catalogs, brochures, posters, display visuals, and branded merchandise – all customizable for your region.	aminol_official_dealer/d747b3dd0f43a2f2f7c21b31efdbf7c1354f0f88.jpg	Digital content packages:  Social media visuals, short videos, ad banners, and localized copy for online marketing.\r\n\r\nBranding guidelines:  Access to official Aminol brand identity files, tone of voice guides, and layout templates to keep your communication consistent.\r\n\r\nCampaign support:  We help you plan local promotions, product launches, and digital campaigns that match your market strategy.\r\n\r\nEvent & POS assistance:  Support for exhibitions, trade shows, and point-of-sale branding to enhance visibility on the ground.
\.
COPY public.services_aminol_official_dealer_content (id, title, description, image, aminol_official_dealer_id) FROM stdin;
1	Strengthen your business	If you choose Aminol, you choose for the growth of your business. As an Aminol dealer, we offer you a wide range of technical and commercial support, specifically designed to strengthen your operations.	aminol_official_dealer_content/61fa703d01ea76d8893a71f532c6a9946aa6c7c3.jpg	1
2	Availability	The Aminol Official Dealer formula is growing rapidly and is available in more and more countries. Depending on the country, the content of the formula can vary. Please contact Sales International for availability in your country.	aminol_official_dealer_content/6352db09fb21f203ab80eed240ad60d58df5e355.jpg	1
3	Support for Distributors	Aminol provides strong support at every stage — from product selection to market development and sales organization.\r\n\r\nWe offer:\r\nA dedicated account manager for each partner — your go-to person for everything.\r\nTraining and product knowledge materials — so your team can confidently promote Aminol products.\r\nOpportunities for exclusive sales rights — based on region and market potential	aminol_official_dealer_content/61bdadb705de5524b03ff2946453ef539f4b83e7.jpg	1
\.
